[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1143","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1143.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1201","title":"Check Point FireWall-1 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Check Point FireWall-1 防火墙产品存在拒绝服务漏洞，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标设备的 264 端口发送大量数据包（即泛洪攻击）来触发该漏洞。由于 FireWall-1 在处理到达 264 端口的异常高流量时缺乏适当的速率限制和资源保护机制，攻击者发送的数据包洪流会持续占用目标系统大量 CPU 资源，导致防火墙性能急剧下降甚至完全停止响应网络流量，从而造成合法用户的网络访问中断，影响范围包括所有部署了受影响版本 Check Point FireWall-1 的企业网络边界安全防护。该漏洞利用条件极为简单：攻击者仅需在网络中能够访问目标 FireWall-1 的 264 端口即可发起攻击，无需任何身份验证凭据，攻击复杂度低，危害等级中等。Check Point 已通过发布安全更新修复了该漏洞，管理员应尽快升级至修复版本，并考虑在网络边界对 264 端口实施访问控制限制以降低被利用的风险。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1201"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-08-31T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:22Z","remediation":"升级到 Check Point 已修复该漏洞的 FireWall-1 后续版本（FireWall-1 4.1 SP8 或更高版本），并确保已应用最新安全补丁包。在边界路由器或上游设备上配置 ACL 规则，阻断外部对端口 264 的未授权访问。如无法立即升级，可在防火墙层面设置速率限制（rate limiting）以控制流入端口 264 的数据包速率，并启用异常流量检测告警。建议同时检查 FireWall-1 日志中是否存在来自单一源 IP 的大规模连接请求，及时封禁可疑来源。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0085.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9c6bb4d80b2633b04c3d95cd11fee4b8b1b012c2/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1201.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/559ec87f609d31af7a4580139706f217d81d7a2e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1201.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1201","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1201.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1201.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-12xx/CVE-2000-1201.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/045dd815c5c9edb2f848de9196b8b22db27288ca/2000/CVE-2000-1201.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/8e09cd003036511dff025515f28920f1d343007b/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1201.md","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/f785f3444159263c9afde232b5456d1f01686673/api/2000/CVE-2000-1201.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1201.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1143.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1142","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1142.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1200","title":"Microsoft Windows NT 域用户信息泄露漏洞","description":"Windows NT 系统的本地安全认证（LSA）服务存在信息泄露漏洞。未经身份验证的远程攻击者可通过建立空会话（null session）的方式，调用 LsaQueryInformationPolicy 策略函数获取域安全标识符（SID），并利用该 SID 枚举出目标域中的所有用户账户信息。该漏洞无需任何身份认证即可利用，攻击者仅需能够网络访问运行 Windows NT 的域控制器或成员服务器的 IPC$ 共享端口（TCP 445/139），即可在不被察觉的情况下完整获取域用户列表，为后续的密码破解、权限提升或横向渗透攻击奠定基础。此漏洞影响所有启用空会话连接的 Windows NT 系统，CVSS v2 评分为 5.0（中等），主要危害为机密信息泄露。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1200"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-08-31T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:21Z","remediation":"安装 Microsoft Windows NT 4.0 安全补丁（Security Bulletin MS01-044，适用于 Service Pack 6a），或通过 Windows Update 自动更新。如无法立即打补丁，可通过注册表限制空会话：将 HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\\SYSTEM\\CurrentControlSet\\Control\\LSA 下的 RestrictAnonymous 值设为 1（或 2 以完全禁用匿名枚举），并删除 NullSessionShares 和 NullSessionPipes 注册表项，然后重启系统。作为临时缓解措施，在防火墙或路由器上阻断 TCP 139、445 和 UDP 137、138 端口，阻止外部攻击者建立空会话。建议同时升级到 Windows 2000 或更高版本以获得完整防护。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/44430","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/959","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4015","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/cbc8909f965784fa84e604f999ad78ba1a862d6c/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1200.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1200","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d9d0e44f54f90ad1b4ec106b1cac94be29b99757/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1200.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1200.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1200.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/9854c179c024bf1d349f724d8589444858e69aa7/2000/CVE-2000-1200.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/8e09cd003036511dff025515f28920f1d343007b/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1200.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-12xx/CVE-2000-1200.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1200.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1200.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1142.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1141","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1141.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1197","title":"imap-uw 邮件服务 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"imap-uw IMAP 软件包中的 POP2/POP3 服务器（pop3d）在 FreeBSD 及其他操作系统上存在拒绝服务漏洞。该漏洞源于 pop3d 服务创建邮件锁定文件时使用可预测的文件名，攻击者可以通过在特定路径下创建指向其他用户邮箱的锁定文件，使得其他用户无法正常访问其邮件，从而造成拒绝服务。在本地 unprivileged 权限下即可触发，无需远程访问。攻击者无需特殊工具，仅需在本地创建同名或相似的锁定文件即可。该漏洞影响范围包括运行 imap-uw IMAP 软件包的 FreeBSD 及其他类 Unix 系统。CVSS 评分 2.1（仅影响完整性无可用性），危害等级较低。建议升级 imap-uw 软件包至最新版本或应用厂商提供的补丁。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1197"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-08-31T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:21Z","remediation":"升级 imap-uw 至 2000c 或更高版本（修复了 POP2/POP3 锁文件可预测名称漏洞）。若无法立即升级，可将邮件锁文件目录权限设为 1777 (sticky bit) 并限制为 root 所有，防止普通用户创建他人邮箱锁文件；或在 /etc/inetd.conf 中禁用 POP2/POP3 服务（注释掉 pop2/pop3 行）并重启 inetd。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=95624629924545&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1132","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e3ffc8aa96e889e4591b3a2ccc4e1f7e6b2ab4fc/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1197.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8d0003712fd6ee4e2d0881313cc643a9a3a69d63/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1197.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1197","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1197.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1197.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/e60bb3a306b43cc668d535cff411b9566d5ecc1b/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-11xx/CVE-2000-1197.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/050f0b0b35f5586b897c9fa1e5cb22907b6f29e8/2000/CVE-2000-1197.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/aa26e43cea95c9f8fa4c03fce1cced7c702a4035/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1197.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1197.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1197.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1141.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1139","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1139.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1195","title":"Linux Netkit telnetd 认证绕过漏洞","description":"Linux netkit 套件中的 telnetd 守护进程在启用 -L 命令行选项运行时存在认证绕过漏洞。远程攻击者无需任何身份认证，通过特制的 telnet 会话即可绕过登录验证直接访问目标系统，导致机密性、完整性和可用性部分受损。该漏洞影响 netkit-telnet-0.16 之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1195"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-08-31T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:21Z","remediation":"升级 netkit-telnet 至 0.16 或更高版本。如使用 Caldera OpenLinux，安装 CSSA-2000-008 安全更新。若无法升级，建议禁用 telnetd 的 -L 选项或直接禁用 telnet 服务，改用 SSH。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.caldera.com/support/security/advisories/CSSA-2000-008.0.txt","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4225","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/cbc8909f965784fa84e604f999ad78ba1a862d6c/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1195.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d9d0e44f54f90ad1b4ec106b1cac94be29b99757/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1195.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1195","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1195.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1195.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-11xx/CVE-2000-1195.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/bd65d87495327c522ef03e0100b7141c41565410/2000/CVE-2000-1195.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/8e09cd003036511dff025515f28920f1d343007b/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1195.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1195.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1195.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1139.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1138","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1138.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1194","title":"Argosoft FRP Server 远程拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Argosoft FRP Server 1.0 存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可向 FTP 服务的 USER 或 CWD 命令发送超长字符串，触发缓冲区溢出，导致服务进程崩溃拒绝服务，在特定条件下可执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 Argosoft FRP Server 1.0 版本，CVSS v2.0 评分 7.5，危害等级高。厂商未提供官方补丁，建议升级至更高版本或限制对 FTP 服务的访问。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1194"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-08-31T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:21Z","remediation":"Argosoft FRP server 1.0 已停止维护，官方不再提供补丁，建议立即迁移至仍在维护的 FTP 服务端软件（如 vsftpd、ProFTPD 或 FileZilla Server）。若暂时无法迁移，先在防火墙层面仅允许受信任来源 IP 访问 21 端口并配置访问白名单、关闭匿名登录；同时在服务端限制 USER、CWD 命令参数长度（不超过 128 字符），并在网关部署规则拦截参数异常超长的 FTP 命令流量，以缓解远程拒绝服务与潜在命令执行风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.mdma.za.net/fk/FK9.zip","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1227","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/86965a1ef7a64a35a4bffc5193446981deb1b2f5/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1194.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d9d0e44f54f90ad1b4ec106b1cac94be29b99757/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1194.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1194","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1194.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1194.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-11xx/CVE-2000-1194.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/6c23d699ab95dd8042ecb6df739cafdf209913a6/2000/CVE-2000-1194.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/8e09cd003036511dff025515f28920f1d343007b/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1194.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1194.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1194.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1138.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1137","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1137.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1192","title":"BTT Software SNMP Trap Watcher 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"BTT Software SNMP Trap Watcher 1.16 存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的超长字符串 trap 消息触发该漏洞，导致目标程序缓冲区溢出，造成拒绝服务，甚至可能执行任意命令。该漏洞无需身份认证即可远程利用，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。受影响版本为 SNMP Trap Watcher 1.16，建议用户升级至最新版本或停止使用该软件。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1192"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-08-31T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:21Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 SNMP Trap Watcher 至最新版本 1.41（官网下载地址 http://www.bttsoftware.co.uk/snmptrap.html），该版本已修复 1.16 中的缓冲区溢出漏洞。如无法升级，可在防火墙或主机层面限制 UDP 端口 162 的入站流量，仅允许受信任的 SNMP 管理端发送 Trap 数据包，以降低远程攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.bttsoftware.co.uk/snmptrap.html","http://www.securiteam.com/windowsntfocus/5ZP0C000KC.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/985","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/86965a1ef7a64a35a4bffc5193446981deb1b2f5/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1192.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d9d0e44f54f90ad1b4ec106b1cac94be29b99757/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1192.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1192","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1192.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1192.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-11xx/CVE-2000-1192.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/24bf8ab9ac19d70e8e7ca347101f59bbc2694f11/2000/CVE-2000-1192.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/8e09cd003036511dff025515f28920f1d343007b/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1192.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1192.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1192.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1137.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0933","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0933.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1191","title":"htdig htsearch 错误消息泄露物理路径漏洞","description":"htDig 的 htsearch 程序在 3.2 beta、3.1.6、3.1.5 及更早版本中存在信息泄露漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向 config 参数传递一个不存在的配置文件路径，触发程序返回包含服务器物理路径详细信息的错误消息，从而获取目标系统的目录结构信息。该漏洞利用条件简单，无需身份认证，攻击者仅需构造特制 HTTP 请求即可实施探测，为后续攻击提供信息收集基础。CWE-209 归类为通过错误消息导致的信息暴露。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1191"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-08-31T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:20Z","remediation":"升级 ht://Dig 至 3.2.0b6 或更新版本（SourceForge 可下载），该版本修复了 config 参数错误消息泄露物理路径的问题。如无法升级，修改 htsearch 程序源码，在错误处理函数中将真实路径替换为占位符（如 \"/var/www/html\" 替换为 \"[REDACTED]\"），并确保 Web 服务器配置中 display_errors 为 Off，禁止向远程客户端输出详细错误信息。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securiteam.com/exploits/htDig_reveals_web_server_configuration_paths.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4366","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7367","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A10526","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/86965a1ef7a64a35a4bffc5193446981deb1b2f5/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1191.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d9d0e44f54f90ad1b4ec106b1cac94be29b99757/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1191.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1191","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1191.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1191.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/24bf8ab9ac19d70e8e7ca347101f59bbc2694f11/2000/CVE-2000-1191.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/8e09cd003036511dff025515f28920f1d343007b/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1191.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-11xx/CVE-2000-1191.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1191.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/b41e970743d15aec60299cbc12139ba5a0ac3bb6/content/CVE-2000-1191.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0933.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0932","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0932.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1190","title":"imwheel imwheel-solo 符号链接攻击任意文件修改漏洞","description":"imwheel 工具包中的 imwheel-solo 程序存在符号链接攻击漏洞。该程序在处理用户主目录下的 .imwheelrc 配置文件时，未对符号链接进行安全校验，本地攻击者可在该文件中预创建指向任意系统文件的符号链接，诱使 imwheel-solo 按当前运行用户权限对其写入或覆盖，从而修改任意文件内容。该漏洞影响安装 imwheel 软件包的本地系统，攻击者需具备本地访问权限并诱导目标用户或特权进程触发程序执行，属于典型的本地符号链接竞争类漏洞，CVSS 评分为 2.1，危害等级较低。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1190"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-08-31T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:20Z","remediation":"建议升级 imwheel 到修复符号链接跟随问题的后续版本（1.0 及以后），并收紧本地权限配置：对 ~/.imwheelrc 设置 `chmod 600 ~/.imwheelrc`、`chmod 700 ~` 限制属主读写，避免使用符号链接指向该文件；切勿以 root 身份运行 imwheel-solo，改以普通用户执行；同时将配置文件从 /tmp 等共享可写目录移出，并定期检查相关目录内是否存在指向敏感文件的符号链接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=95984116811100&w=2","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/4941.php","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-016.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e409cc3aa72de0994d4d1b2baf38bcac39a42cdc/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1190.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/003831a52157fd63351f2c9a1ee0ba9350abc5b2/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1190.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1190","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1190.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1190.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/93d966ccbf562a1a0fe2dcab2089012ce2b11591/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-11xx/CVE-2000-1190.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/47bb69b00d30a4ddac9a224d4b4672d3efbf78ef/2000/CVE-2000-1190.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/aa26e43cea95c9f8fa4c03fce1cced7c702a4035/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1190.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1190.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1190.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0932.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0843","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0843.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1199","title":"PostgreSQL 数据库明文存储密码漏洞","description":"PostgreSQL 在系统表 pg_shadow 与 pg_pwd 中以明文形式存储用户账号和密码信息。具有足够数据库权限的本地攻击者可通过直接查询或访问这些系统表获取敏感凭据，进而登录数据库并读取、篡改或删除数据。该漏洞影响 PostgreSQL 6.3.2 和 6.5.3 等早期版本。攻击者通常需要先获得操作系统层面的有效账户或数据库角色权限，才能执行相关查询操作。建议将 PostgreSQL 升级至修复版本，并对数据库用户权限进行最小化配置，以降低敏感信息泄露风险。\"\"\"\n```\n\nWait, it seems like the description field got corrupted with some template/thinking content mixed in. The actual value part starts with `<value>PostgreSQL...` but there's garbage before it.\n\nSo the task is clear: provide a clean, proper Chinese description for the `description` field.\n\nRequirements:\n- ≥50 Chinese characters\n- Cover: vulnerability principle (plaintext password storage), affected versions/products (PostgreSQL 6.3.2/6.5.3), attack conditions (local, requires sufficient privileges, no authentication needed for the attack itself)\n- Translate NVD English description to fluent Chinese\n- Supplement with local data technical details\n- Don't fabricate URLs or version numbers\n\nCurrent description in the TOML is actually decent but it seems the parser/extractor failed because of the garbage content before `<value>`. But I should provide a clean, proper description.\n\nLet me write a good description:\n\nPostgreSQL 数据库系统在系统表 pg_shadow 和 pg_pwd 中以明文形式存储用户账号及密码信息，存在敏感凭据泄露漏洞。具有足够数据库权限的本地攻击者可直接查询这些系统表获取明文密码，进而登录数据库并读取、篡改或删除数据。该漏洞影响 PostgreSQL 6.3.2 和 6.5.3 等早期版本。根据 CVSS 评分 4.6，攻击需本地访问权限且需要具备足够的数据库权限（Au:N），攻击复杂度低。建议升级至修复版本，并使用加密认证方式替代明文密码存储。\n\nLet me count characters... That's definitely >50 characters. Let me verify it covers all requirements:\n- 漏洞原理: 明文存储密码，查询系统表获取凭据 ✓\n- 影响范围: PostgreSQL 6.3.2 和 6.5.3 ✓\n- 攻击条件: 本地访问，需要足够数据库权限 ✓\n- 中文 ✓\n- ≥50字 ✓\n\nThis looks good. I should output it in the required format.\n\nWait, I need to be careful about the output format. The instructions say:\n\"你可以先简要分析，但**最终答案必须**放在一对 <value>...\n","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1199"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-08-31T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:21Z","remediation":"升级 PostgreSQL 至 7.2 或更高版本，使用 CREATE USER/ALTER USER 的 ENCRYPTED 选项并将 pg_hba.conf 中的认证方式配置为 md5，确保密码以 MD5 加密形式存储而非明文。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=95659987018649&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1139","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4364","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19875","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/cbc8909f965784fa84e604f999ad78ba1a862d6c/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1199.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d9d0e44f54f90ad1b4ec106b1cac94be29b99757/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1199.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1199","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1199.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1199.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/c9ca0c7ecb65f7366b1a83938dcd1c80cf9c2d0e/2000/CVE-2000-1199.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-11xx/CVE-2000-1199.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/8e09cd003036511dff025515f28920f1d343007b/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1199.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1199.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1199.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0843.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0840","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0840.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1198","title":"高通 qpopper 文件锁定拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Qualcomm qpopper 2.53/3.0、RedHat imap 4.5 及 UoW imap 4.5 的 popd 服务在创建邮箱锁文件时使用可预测的文件名，本地攻击者可通过预先创建目标用户的锁文件，导致合法用户无法访问邮件服务，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞属于不当锁定机制（CWE-667），攻击向量为本地（AV:L），需低权限（PR:L）且无需用户交互（UI:N），主要影响可用性（A:H），CVSS 3.1 评分 5.5（中危）。攻击者只需拥有本地系统访问权限，即可通过创建同名锁文件阻断其他用户的 POP 邮件收取功能。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1198"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-08-31T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:21Z","remediation":"升级 qpopper 至 4.0 或更高版本（采用随机锁文件名），升级 UW imap 至 2000 年 9 月后版本，RedHat 用户安装 imap-4.5-5 或更新的 RPM 包。若无法立即升级，可通过设置邮箱目录粘滞位（chmod +t /var/spool/mail）防止非所有者创建锁文件，或配置 POP 服务使用非预测性锁文件路径。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=95624629924545&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=95634229925906&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1132","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19869","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/550055bfe9781275ad9633a348ccd82fcad2554b/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1198.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8d0003712fd6ee4e2d0881313cc643a9a3a69d63/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1198.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1198","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1198.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1198.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/7db0f900e976b2d58489b930c23b9f965721c4a6/2000/CVE-2000-1198.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/aa26e43cea95c9f8fa4c03fce1cced7c702a4035/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1198.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/e60bb3a306b43cc668d535cff411b9566d5ecc1b/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-11xx/CVE-2000-1198.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1198.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1198.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0840.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0839","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0839.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1196","title":"Netscape PublishingXpert 本地文件读取漏洞","description":"Netscape PublishingXpert 2.0、2.2 及 2.5 版本（2.5 在 SP2 之前）存在路径遍历漏洞，其错误页面脚本 PSCOErrPage.htm 中的 errPagePath 参数未对用户输入进行有效过滤和验证。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过在 errPagePath 参数中指定目标服务器上的任意文件路径，向该 Web 应用发送恶意请求，从而读取服务器文件系统中的任意文件内容。攻击者利用此漏洞可获取配置文件、密码文件等敏感信息，进而为进一步入侵提供情报支持。该漏洞影响范围覆盖 Netscape PublishingXpert 2.0/2.2/2.5 多个版本，CVSS v2 评分 5.0，危害等级中等。Netscape 已在 2.5 SP2 中修复了此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1196"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-08-31T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:21Z","remediation":"升级 Netscape PublishingXpert 至 2.5 SP2 或更高版本以修复 PSCOErrPage.htm 路径遍历漏洞。如暂无法升级，可临时删除或限制访问 /PSUser/PSCOErrPage.htm 文件，或在 Web 服务器层面对 errPagePath 参数进行过滤，阻止包含 ../ 或绝对路径的请求，同时检查系统日志确认是否存在未授权文件读取痕迹。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://docs.iplanet.com/docs/manuals/pubx/2.5.2_Relnotes.html","http://packetstormsecurity.org/0004-exploits/ooo1.txt","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7362","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20966","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2000/CVE-2000-1196.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/cbc8909f965784fa84e604f999ad78ba1a862d6c/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1196.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2000/CVE-2000-1196.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d9d0e44f54f90ad1b4ec106b1cac94be29b99757/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1196.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1196","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1196.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-1196.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1196.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2000/CVE-2000-1196.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-11xx/CVE-2000-1196.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0839.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0838","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0838.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1193","title":"SGI IRIX Performance Copilot PMCD 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"SGI IRIX 6.x 的 Performance Copilot 组件中的 Performance Metrics Collector Daemon (PMCD) 存在资源耗尽漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可向 PMCD 端口发送超长字符串，导致目标系统 CPU 和内存资源被大量消耗，最终造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 IRIX 6.3/6.4/6.5 等多个版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1193"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-08-31T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:21Z","remediation":"建议立即应用 SGI 于 2002 年 4 月发布的安全补丁（参见 advisory 20020407-01-I），升级 PMCD 组件至修复版本。如无法升级，可在防火墙上限制对 PMCD 端口（默认 4321/TCP）的访问，仅允许受信任的管理主机连接。由于 SGI IRIX 已停止维护，建议尽快迁移至受支持的操作系统平台。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-04/0056.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4284","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21431","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/86965a1ef7a64a35a4bffc5193446981deb1b2f5/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1193.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d9d0e44f54f90ad1b4ec106b1cac94be29b99757/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1193.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1193","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1193.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1193.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/6c23d699ab95dd8042ecb6df739cafdf209913a6/2000/CVE-2000-1193.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-11xx/CVE-2000-1193.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/8e09cd003036511dff025515f28920f1d343007b/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1193.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1193.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1193.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0838.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1145","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1145.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1203","title":"Lotus Domino SMTP 服务器拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Lotus Domino SMTP 服务器 4.63 至 5.08 版本存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者无需任何身份验证，即可通过伪造一封发件人为 bounce@[127.0.0.1]（本地回环地址）的电子邮件消息触发该漏洞。由于 Domino 邮件系统将该地址识别为本地系统产生的自动退信地址，会将伪造邮件视为内部系统产生的退信，导致服务器进入无限邮件循环状态，持续消耗大量 CPU 资源。成功利用后，攻击者可导致目标 Domino 服务器 CPU 占用率飙升，造成正常邮件服务中断，影响企业的邮件通信和业务运转。该漏洞影响范围覆盖 Lotus Domino 4.63 到 5.0.8 版本的所有 SMTP 服务器实例。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1203"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-08-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:22Z","remediation":"建议升级 Lotus Domino 至 5.0.9 或更高版本（如 5.0.10、6.0 以上），该版本修复了 SMTP 邮件循环漏洞。若暂时无法升级，可在服务器配置文件 notes.ini 中添加 SMTPMTA_Deny_Relay=1 禁止开放中继，并在配置文档中设置\"拒绝发件人为本地地址的外部邮件\"规则，同时在防火墙层面限制 25 端口仅允许受信 IP 访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=vuln-dev&m=95886062521327&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/209754","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3212","http://www.securityfocus.com/cgi-bin/archive.pl?id=1&start=2002-01-21&end=2002-01-27&mid=209116&threads=1","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7012","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9c6bb4d80b2633b04c3d95cd11fee4b8b1b012c2/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1203.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1203","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/559ec87f609d31af7a4580139706f217d81d7a2e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1203.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1203.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/045dd815c5c9edb2f848de9196b8b22db27288ca/2000/CVE-2000-1203.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1203.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/8e09cd003036511dff025515f28920f1d343007b/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1203.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-12xx/CVE-2000-1203.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1203.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/b41e970743d15aec60299cbc12139ba5a0ac3bb6/content/CVE-2000-1203.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1145.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0996","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0996.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0892","title":"多厂商 Telnet 客户端环境变量信息泄露漏洞","description":"某些 Telnet 客户端实现存在信息泄露漏洞。远程攻击者可通过搭建恶意的 Telnet 服务器，在客户端连接时请求获取客户端的敏感环境变量（如 USER、HOME、PATH 等），或通过 telnet: URL 方式诱导用户访问恶意 Web 页面来间接获取这些信息。该漏洞可能导致用户账户名、目录路径等敏感信息泄露，为后续针对性攻击提供便利。攻击条件要求用户主动连接恶意 Telnet 服务器或点击恶意链接，CVSS 评分 2.6，危害等级低。","severity":"LOW","score":2.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0892"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2001-07-21T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:41Z","remediation":"建议停止使用 Telnet 协议，改用 SSH（OpenSSH 等）替代所有远程登录场景，从根本上消除环境变量泄露风险。如因兼容性必须保留 Telnet，请升级 telnet 客户端至最新版本，并在客户端配置中禁用环境变量传递（如设置 `ENV_DISPLAY=0` 或限制 `DISPLAY`、`TERM` 等敏感变量）。在防火墙上封禁 Telnet 端口（TCP 23）的出站连接，防止客户端意外连接到恶意服务器。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/22404","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6644","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2000/CVE-2000-0892.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f7f0337cfdc7d8aab4c9eb0d8a44be53baa8f88d/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0892.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2000/CVE-2000-0892.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2000/CVE-2000-0892.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df225994fea2bf22c3b73491021c40bfd2f964e1/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0892.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0892","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0892.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0892.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0892.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2000/CVE-2000-0892.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0996.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0995","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0995.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0891","title":"IBM Lotus Notes 默认 ECL 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Lotus Notes 5.02 之前版本存在默认执行控制列表（ECL）配置缺陷，远程攻击者可通过向目标用户发送包含恶意程序的电子邮件附件，当用户打开邮件时该程序自动执行，导致任意代码执行。该漏洞影响 Lotus Notes 5.02 之前所有版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，且无需用户交互以外的额外条件，可完全控制受影响的系统。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0891"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2001-07-21T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:41Z","remediation":"立即升级 Lotus Notes 至 5.02 或更高版本，该版本修复了默认 ECL 允许自动执行邮件附件的缺陷。如无法升级，请在用户首选项中手动收紧 ECL 安全策略，将\"允许自动执行\"设置为禁用，并禁止非信任来源的嵌入式代码运行。同时建议在邮件服务器层面过滤可疑附件类型（如 .exe、.vbs、.js），并加强用户安全意识培训，不打开来历不明的邮件附件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/5962","http://www.notes.net/R5FixList.nsf/Search%21SearchView&Query=CBAT45TU9S","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5045","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f7f0337cfdc7d8aab4c9eb0d8a44be53baa8f88d/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0891.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df225994fea2bf22c3b73491021c40bfd2f964e1/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0891.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0891","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0891.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0891.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/d6e5bf87d27954c5a3cd48e565b212fb97932a81/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-08xx/CVE-2000-0891.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/a8d9b19e8bcb98a5a7dedc851836a009f19fbc3e/2000/CVE-2000-0891.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/68a8e7c8b5d4a203080f3ef6d3d4e3df346511fe/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0891.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0891.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0891.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0995.toml"}]